                "content": "During active incident triage, background noise, low-bandwidth audio bridges, and diverse international accents can cause miscomprehension. Analysts must apply deliberate vocal chunking, measured pacing (120-140 words per minute), and explicit verbal signposting. Never allow an ambiguous statement or unconfirmed action item to remain unresolved.",
