                "content": "In modern Security Operations Centers (SOC), precision of language directly impacts mean time to detect (MTTD) and mean time to respond (MTTR). During this lesson on 'Handle questions and uncertainty', practitioners master accurate phonetic stress, unambiguous sentence construction, and disciplined readback protocols. This ensures critical telemetry\u2014such as IP addresses, hashes, event IDs, and severity classifications\u2014is conveyed without loss of fidelity across high-stress communication channels.",
